pillkit-tj-fonts — package license

This package is a MIXED-LICENSE payload; the package.json `license` field
is "SEE LICENSE IN LICENSE" and this file is that license.

1. This package contains no code of its own. The stylesheet `fonts.css`,
   the package manifest and the documentation are dedicated to the
   public domain to the extent jurisdiction allows; where a formal
   license is required, the MIT License (reproduced below) applies to
   them.

2. The bundled font files in fonts/ (xcharter-400.woff2,
   xcharter-400italic.woff2, xcharter-700.woff2, xcharter-700italic.woff2)
   are NOT covered by the MIT License. They are FREE fonts distributed
   under the Bitstream Charter license terms — free use, copy, modify,
   sublicense, sell and redistribute, with the license notice kept
   intact on all copies. The verbatim license text, the XCharter
   attribution and the redistribution terms live in LICENSE-FONTS.md
   next to this file.

3. Graphik is NOT part of this payload in any form (name aside): the
   Commercial Type EULA grants usage licenses, not redistribution
   rights. See the "What is NOT here" section of LICENSE-FONTS.md.

